{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"493","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Vasya and Wrestling"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya has become interested in wrestling. In wrestling wrestlers use techniques for which they are awarded points by judges. The wrestler who gets the most points wins."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"When the numbers of points of both wrestlers are equal, the wrestler whose sequence of points is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"lexicographically greater"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", wins."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If the sequences of the awarded points coincide, the wrestler who performed the last technique wins. Your task is to determine which wrestler won."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of techniques that the wrestlers have used ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 2·105"},{"kind":"text","text":"). "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain integer numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|ai| ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai ≠ 0"},{"kind":"text","text":"). If "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" is positive, that means that the first wrestler performed the technique that was awarded with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" points. And if "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" is negative, that means that the second wrestler performed the technique that was awarded with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"( - ai)"},{"kind":"text","text":" points."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The techniques are given in chronological order."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If the first wrestler wins, print string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"first"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", otherwise print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"second"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\""}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n1\n2\n-3\n-4\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"second\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block